<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Move all items from one object to another.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>This only moves items from the default location to another default location.  This means that when moving items from a creature it is only moving items from the backpack to the other backpack (equipped items are not considered).
</p>
